# bend-cad: law 11, solve_refused (PLAN-sk13a S6): what a refusal means
# today. If no level certifies the drawing g0, the drawing itself is not a
# regular solution of the system solved in the free variables: if it were,
# law 10 (lib/completepf.bend: solve_complete) would certify every drawing
# near it at some level, and g0 is as near to itself as can be. Proofs
# only.
#
# Generated from tools/drafts/refusedpf.draft by tools/expand.py; edit the
# draft.

